# FitKart — Food Nutrition Search API key
#
# The Food Nutrition Search feature (on the AI Diet Recommendation page)
# queries the USDA FoodData Central API, a free, public nutrition database.
#
# HOW TO GET A KEY (takes ~1 minute, no credit card):
#   1. Go to https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
#   2. Enter your email, submit — the key is emailed to you instantly.
#   3. Paste it below.
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE:
#   1. Copy this file and rename the copy to ".env" (same folder, project root).
#   2. Replace the placeholder value below with your real key.
#   3. Restart "npm run dev" after creating/editing .env — Vite only reads
#      env files at server start.
#
# If you skip this step entirely, the app falls back to USDA's public
# "DEMO_KEY", which works out of the box for testing but is rate-limited
# to ~30 requests/hour and ~50/day per IP address — fine for trying the
# feature, not for real users. Get your own free key before shipping.
#
# This file (.env.example) is safe to commit. The real ".env" file is
# already listed in .gitignore and will never be committed.

VITE_NUTRITION_API_KEY=your_usda_api_key_here
